//----------------------------------------
//    The turbolift's deck list for the whole ship (Long Way Home).
//    Same format as the game's own ext_data/sp_turbolift.dat, which lists the ten decks that were
//    separate levels; this lists all fifteen. Decks 6, 7, 12, 13 and 14 are generated placeholders
//    and their names are invented (docs/lore-ledger.md). The computer's voice exists only for the
//    game's own decks.
//----------------------------------------

